  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Let $f_k(n)$ be the maximum possible chromatic number of a graph with $n$ vertices which contains no $K_k$.\nIs it true that, for $k\\geq 4$, $ f_k(n) \\gg \\frac{n^{1-\\frac{1}{k-1}}}{(\\log n)^{c_k}} $ for some constant $c_k>0$?",
